WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:03:09.300
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
03:09.570 --> 03:13.449
Shan, you've been really strong all these years.

3
03:13.449 --> 03:14.200
There he is.

4
03:14.200 --> 03:14.992
Hey.

5
03:16.827 --> 03:18.120
I want to go to college already.

6
03:18.120 --> 03:20.122
I’m just looking forward to that freedom.

7
03:20.122 --> 03:26.379
Is it really freedom, or are you escaping?

8
03:27.046 --> 03:28.339
What's the difference?

9
03:29.798 --> 03:31.312
For me, they're both the same.

10
03:31.328 --> 03:32.955
I'm not the type of guy who commits.

11
03:32.980 --> 03:38.736
Let me guess, girl number 1,569.

12
03:39.991 --> 03:41.743
Shan, the heartbreaker.

13
03:42.616 --> 03:44.243
Someday, you'll meet your match.

14
03:44.283 --> 03:45.272
Do I know you?

15
03:45.297 --> 03:48.342
Oh, I’m sorry. Do you want me to remind you?

16
03:48.497 --> 03:49.665
You're just a stranger to me.

17
03:49.830 --> 03:51.207
And I love challenges.

18
03:51.916 --> 03:53.167
You’d know, right?

19
03:53.876 --> 03:55.127
Because we're the same.

20
04:03.219 --> 04:04.178
Good morning.

21
04:05.137 --> 04:06.847
Welcome to Yesterday’s Coffee.

22
05:54.438 --> 05:57.608
Finally, there are no more monsters here.

23
06:20.623 --> 06:23.151
You seem quieter today, Shan.

24
06:24.494 --> 06:26.371
Is something bothering you?

25
06:32.317 --> 06:34.194
I'm just thinking of my mom.

26
06:45.604 --> 06:47.898
Her death anniversary is coming up soon.

27
06:51.737 --> 06:52.651
You know,

28
06:53.627 --> 06:55.295
I just realized how…

29
06:56.888 --> 06:58.890
fast everything happened back then.

30
07:00.026 --> 07:00.944
When...

31
07:01.643 --> 07:02.977
When she passed.

32
07:03.401 --> 07:04.694
I understand.

33
07:05.903 --> 07:08.471
You're still processing what happened.

34
07:09.490 --> 07:11.325
Yeah, I guess...

35
07:11.325 --> 07:12.952
I guess I'm getting there.

36
07:13.911 --> 07:17.081
But whenever I think about everything that happened

37
07:17.081 --> 07:18.471
I still get shocked.

38
07:19.576 --> 07:22.120
I was so young when all of it happened.

39
07:23.300 --> 07:26.720
It was a lot to take for a young boy.

40
07:28.259 --> 07:31.179
But lately, I realized that

41
07:31.983 --> 07:34.027
even though Mom left early,

42
07:35.365 --> 07:36.866
she didn't abandon me.

43
07:42.857 --> 07:45.860
She made sure that even if she left early,

44
07:47.101 --> 07:48.602
I wouldn't struggle.

45
07:50.622 --> 07:52.040
You know Shan,

46
07:52.689 --> 07:54.982
I'm glad you went to high school here.

47
07:55.305 --> 07:56.306
At least,

48
07:56.331 --> 07:58.333
I get to see you from time to time.

49
07:58.786 --> 08:01.080
Don't treat me as a School Director, okay?

50
08:01.711 --> 08:02.754
I’m family.

51
08:05.348 --> 08:07.433
I really see my sister in you.

52
08:11.427 --> 08:13.554
How have you been? How are you?

53
08:18.017 --> 08:19.727
I'm feeling better now.

54
08:20.770 --> 08:21.813
Uhm…

55
08:21.813 --> 08:27.276
Your dad said you're not ready to face people yet,

56
08:27.276 --> 08:30.238
And he doesn't want me to see you yet

57
08:30.238 --> 08:32.281
while you're still grieving.

58
08:34.200 --> 08:35.493
You know Shan,

59
08:35.493 --> 08:38.057
I was able to see your mom before she passed.

60
08:38.133 --> 08:41.803
She asked me to help process some documents.

61
08:42.625 --> 08:43.709
Here they are.

62
08:44.882 --> 08:47.634
I know you're probably too young to understand.

63
08:48.548 --> 08:53.010
This involves your mom's properties and bank accounts.

64
08:53.553 --> 08:54.776
Don't worry.

65
08:54.971 --> 08:57.974
I'll tell you more about it when you're 18.

66
08:59.684 --> 09:01.432
Once you turn 21,

67
09:01.457 --> 09:04.043
we can start processing the transfer of these,

68
09:04.068 --> 09:07.071
what your mom left under your name.

69
09:18.411 --> 09:19.453
Shan.

70
09:23.271 --> 09:27.283
This is your mom's last wish.

71
09:29.122 --> 09:31.040
Always remember Shan,

72
09:31.065 --> 09:33.401
your mom loved you so much.

73
09:33.808 --> 09:34.627
Hm?

74
09:39.473 --> 09:41.049
It's just bittersweet

75
09:42.351 --> 09:45.634
because it really seemed like she prepared for the day

76
09:46.022 --> 09:47.197
she would leave me.

77
09:54.678 --> 09:57.674
When the properties Mom left were finally transferred to me,

78
09:58.451 --> 10:02.163
I thought it was the best time to sort my life out.

79
10:09.962 --> 10:11.820
There's a lot of fixing to do.

80
10:17.110 --> 10:21.023
I want to take care of and fix the things Mom left me.

81
10:27.218 --> 10:30.847
In that way… Maybe I can fix myself too.

82
10:46.874 --> 10:49.919
- Hey, surprise! - Hello!

83
10:49.919 --> 10:51.571
Hi, Shan!

84
10:51.596 --> 10:53.172
We're here for the house tour.

85
10:53.172 --> 10:54.423
- And— - Yeah.

86
10:54.423 --> 10:55.466
making Hiro jealous.

87
10:55.466 --> 10:56.592
It's beautiful.

88
10:56.745 --> 10:58.080
We brought something for you.

89
10:58.886 --> 10:59.887
Yes...

90
11:00.221 --> 11:01.364
Wait,

91
11:01.389 --> 11:02.765
what time is it in Florida now?

92
11:02.765 --> 11:04.308
Should we call Hiro?

93
11:04.793 --> 11:06.352
Nah, don't.

94
11:06.507 --> 11:07.675
He's probably busy.

95
11:08.396 --> 11:10.606
- It's so beautiful. - This place is so beautiful.

96
11:10.606 --> 11:11.785
It's so spacious.

97
11:12.441 --> 11:13.567
I already want to live here.

98
11:14.568 --> 11:17.196
Finishings look expensive.

99
11:18.447 --> 11:19.340
How much?

100
11:19.365 --> 11:20.741
I'm not selling it, you dumbass.

101
11:20.741 --> 11:21.951
I just moved in.

102
11:22.201 --> 11:25.981
Wait, what about your condo in Taft?

103
11:26.747 --> 11:27.785
I'm keeping it.

104
11:28.037 --> 11:29.705
This one, and the one in Taft.

105
11:29.730 --> 11:32.733
Both of them are from mom, so I have no plans on selling them.

106
11:33.528 --> 11:35.723
- Okay. - Fine, then what about your coffee shop?

107
11:36.061 --> 11:37.604
You're opening one soon, right?

108
11:38.050 --> 11:39.593
Did that come from your mom too?

109
11:39.844 --> 11:41.106
Let me invest.

110
11:42.138 --> 11:43.556
Are you serious?

111
11:44.265 --> 11:47.810
You believe in me that much that you'd invest in my coffee shop right away?

112
11:47.810 --> 11:49.918
You're not even sure; it might go under, you know?

113
11:50.176 --> 11:51.254
Shan, what are you saying?

114
11:51.647 --> 11:52.565
It’s you we’re talking about here.

115
11:52.565 --> 11:54.400
I mean, you have a good view.

116
11:54.400 --> 11:55.943
You have a good vision of what you want,

117
11:56.277 --> 11:58.098
And we've already tasted your pastries.

118
11:58.237 --> 11:59.488
I've already tasted your coffee.

119
11:59.488 --> 12:01.432
I'm sure it's gonna be a success for you.

120
12:01.457 --> 12:02.754
- Yeah, yeah. - Right?

121
12:02.779 --> 12:04.573
- He's right. - Don’t worry, Shan.

122
12:05.036 --> 12:07.455
So, how much?

123
12:08.497 --> 12:09.373
Come on!

124
12:09.373 --> 12:10.666
- Let's be business partners. - You're so annoying.

125
12:10.666 --> 12:13.294
Acel, Acel, tell Haze to stop being so persistent.

126
12:13.294 --> 12:15.087
Haze, stop, stop.

127
12:15.087 --> 12:17.131
- Stop annoying him. - Okay, okay, okay. Fine.

128
12:18.090 --> 12:19.523
It's kinda crazy though,

129
12:19.548 --> 12:21.820
your interests have really changed, Shan.

130
12:22.477 --> 12:24.280
From parties

131
12:24.305 --> 12:26.098
and sleeping around.

132
12:27.224 --> 12:28.768
- Changed person. - You're focused on law school now and—

133
12:28.768 --> 12:30.430
this, the business stuff.

134
12:32.331 --> 12:34.249
Maybe I'm...

135
12:34.398 --> 12:36.358
getting tired of that kind of lifestyle.

136
12:37.359 --> 12:38.319
Really?

137
12:40.546 --> 12:41.297
No.

138
12:42.156 --> 12:43.157
Not completely.

139
12:45.006 --> 12:47.467
It's hard to let go of something you've gotten used to.

140
12:48.784 --> 12:49.695
Okay.

141
13:13.729 --> 13:14.730
The Americano is good.

142
13:14.939 --> 13:17.191
Bro, this toasted mallow latte,

143
13:17.191 --> 13:18.192
this will be your best seller.

144
13:18.192 --> 13:18.943
I can feel it.

145
13:18.943 --> 13:20.158
- Really? - Mhmm. It's delicious.

146
13:20.694 --> 13:22.446
Where do you get your beans, bro?

147
13:22.446 --> 13:24.365
Even the Americano tastes rich.

148
13:26.107 --> 13:27.234
Secret.

149
13:29.453 --> 13:30.121
Nice.

150
13:30.121 --> 13:31.330
How about you, ma'am?

151
13:31.497 --> 13:33.666
Does the matcha meet your standards?

152
13:34.208 --> 13:35.292
It's good.

153
13:35.543 --> 13:36.877
But like, what's the milk?

154
13:37.090 --> 13:38.091
Change it.

155
13:38.365 --> 13:40.076
Okay. Noted on that.

156
13:44.343 --> 13:45.094
Neil.

157
13:45.301 --> 13:46.143
Bro.

158
13:47.004 --> 13:48.463
Are you still looking for Yanna?

159
13:49.306 --> 13:51.809
Yup. Still can't find her, but

160
13:51.809 --> 13:53.435
Hiro seems desperate already.

161
13:55.893 --> 13:58.103
It's really hard to find someone who doesn't want to be found.

162
13:58.649 --> 14:00.359
I mean I tried asking people.

163
14:00.359 --> 14:01.652
But they haven't seen her though.

164
14:02.236 --> 14:04.190
But like who are her friends?

165
14:04.365 --> 14:05.991
I feel like we should start there.

166
14:06.016 --> 14:08.369
That girl, what’s her name… Sam.

167
14:08.659 --> 14:09.577
- Can you check her— - Right!

168
14:09.577 --> 14:12.079
Check her socials, check her socials. You never know, right?

169
14:20.926 --> 14:21.760
Found her.

170
14:22.923 --> 14:23.299
But Sam isn’t saying anything?

171
14:23.299 --> 14:25.221
Looks like she’s also friends with Yanna.

172
14:25.246 --> 14:26.002
Kierra?

173
14:26.271 --> 14:27.604
Check the other girl’s profile.

174
14:30.318 --> 14:31.152
That’s her.

175
14:31.916 --> 14:32.751
That’s her.

176
14:33.581 --> 14:35.333
Wait, you know her?

177
14:36.038 --> 14:37.497
Are you friends with her?

178
14:37.646 --> 14:39.190
Maybe you can contact her.

179
14:39.457 --> 14:40.624
Is she your ex or something?

180
14:40.774 --> 14:41.650
Is she your ex?

181
14:41.650 --> 14:44.403
Or a fling?

182
14:46.723 --> 14:48.266
I honestly don’t know, guys.

183
14:48.291 --> 14:49.751
I honestly don’t know.

184
14:50.052 --> 14:50.677
Wait!

185
14:50.993 --> 14:52.870
Oh my god, she’s so your type.

186
14:52.870 --> 14:54.722
Maybe you’ve dated before.

187
14:54.747 --> 14:56.874
Or maybe you could date her now

188
14:56.874 --> 14:59.460
and once you're close, you can ask her where Yanna is.

189
14:59.729 --> 15:01.212
Bro, do it for Hiro, right?

190
15:01.212 --> 15:02.046
- Yeah. - Yeah.

191
15:02.046 --> 15:03.005
- That's… - Do you agree?

192
15:03.005 --> 15:03.672
I agree.

193
15:03.672 --> 15:04.548
- I don’t know what— - Right.

194
15:04.924 --> 15:05.979
- These are all men. - Then it’s settled.

195
15:06.217 --> 15:07.843
That is so diabolical.

196
15:07.843 --> 15:08.760
Use a girl?

197
15:19.351 --> 15:21.854
Fix your hair, it's been like that since earlier.

198
15:25.402 --> 15:27.321
Are you guys ordering or what?

199
15:28.595 --> 15:30.597
The barista here is so grumpy.

200
15:31.533 --> 15:32.910
Should we just leave?

201
15:33.089 --> 15:36.217
Oh, sorry, you can't leave since you're already seated.

202
15:36.997 --> 15:37.873
Okay then,

203
15:37.898 --> 15:39.567
what do you recommend here?

204
15:39.962 --> 15:42.506
I think you’ll like the...

205
15:43.587 --> 15:45.214
Iced Spanish Latte.

206
15:45.214 --> 15:47.591
Okay, sure. I'll trust you on this.

207
15:48.458 --> 15:50.001
Just brewed coffee for me.

208
15:50.177 --> 15:52.221
Iced Spanish Latte and brewed coffee.

209
15:52.221 --> 15:53.050
- Yes, please. - Okay.

210
15:53.075 --> 15:54.576
- By the way, - Thank you.

211
15:54.890 --> 15:58.185
you need to order food too. Can't just have drinks.

212
15:58.477 --> 16:01.994
See? The grumpy barista is being demanding, too.

213
16:02.019 --> 16:03.107
It's okay, come on.

214
16:03.107 --> 16:04.608
Should we try their pastries?

215
16:05.567 --> 16:06.693
Looks delicious.

216
16:06.718 --> 16:08.479
- That one. - This one.

217
16:09.169 --> 16:12.172
You know, to be honest, the menu is really promising.

218
16:13.189 --> 16:14.523
But I suggest

219
16:14.834 --> 16:18.337
you add some savory snacks so not everything here is sweet.

220
16:18.455 --> 16:19.039
Good point.

221
16:19.039 --> 16:20.416
Good point.

222
16:21.542 --> 16:23.158
Actually, you know, earlier

223
16:23.637 --> 16:25.854
someone was asking me for fries.

224
16:26.025 --> 16:30.738
Maybe I should add food that's easy to eat while working or studying.

225
16:30.763 --> 16:32.861
Right?

226
16:32.886 --> 16:33.885
That's right. Yeah.

227
16:36.611 --> 16:38.738
There's still so much I need to fix here.

228
16:39.283 --> 16:40.451
It's okay.

229
16:41.061 --> 16:44.606
That's how it is in the beginning, but you'll get used to it.

230
16:46.608 --> 16:48.694
Wait, I just remembered.

231
16:48.852 --> 16:51.104
Someone invited me to this

232
16:51.405 --> 16:53.949
café business conference next week.

233
16:54.350 --> 16:56.002
I can't attend but...

234
16:56.182 --> 16:58.059
if you want, I'll just give you the invite.

235
16:58.620 --> 17:01.623
It's at Claremont Hotel.

236
17:02.750 --> 17:03.959
There you go.

237
17:03.959 --> 17:06.086
Go Shan, that would be a big help to you.

238
17:06.111 --> 17:07.986
Sure, please. Send me the details.

239
17:08.011 --> 17:09.262
Yeah. Sure, sure.

240
17:09.631 --> 17:13.844
So, is this on the house, these pastries and coffee?

241
17:13.844 --> 17:15.095
Oh, you don't have to...

242
17:15.095 --> 17:15.971
Of course.

243
17:15.971 --> 17:18.057
- Of course, of course. - Thank you, thank you.

244
17:18.057 --> 17:18.922
Of course, not.

245
17:20.201 --> 17:21.785
Don't forget to tip, okay?

246
17:22.394 --> 17:23.829
Oh, okay.

247
17:23.854 --> 17:25.314
Thanks anyway.

248
17:26.918 --> 17:28.648
I thought we were getting it for free.

249
17:48.087 --> 17:49.088
Opening a café

250
17:49.088 --> 17:52.091
gave me something I can put my heart and soul into.

251
17:52.800 --> 17:55.052
I want to take care of that business properly.

252
17:56.595 --> 17:58.537
Because it used to be her café,

253
17:58.854 --> 18:00.606
it used to be her business.

254
18:01.328 --> 18:03.330
It was a special place to her heart.

255
18:06.772 --> 18:09.381
And I want that to be a

256
18:09.586 --> 18:12.185
special place for customers too.

257
18:13.143 --> 18:14.936
And how about you, Shan?

258
18:15.406 --> 18:18.409
Is the café also a special place for you?

259
18:22.329 --> 18:26.125
How do you feel when you're at the café?

260
18:28.502 --> 18:29.834
It feels like...

261
18:31.872 --> 18:36.138
Somehow, I’m alive.

262
19:00.356 --> 19:01.982
Seems like the nosy guy isn’t here.

263
19:02.828 --> 19:03.685
Yes!

264
19:03.873 --> 19:06.542
Come on, "us" is not even a thing.

265
19:06.784 --> 19:08.891
What do you mean, not a thing? Look!

266
19:08.917 --> 19:09.751
Yeah, I...

267
19:09.751 --> 19:11.044
A friend?

268
19:11.295 --> 19:13.464
Didn't I tell you what we are?

269
19:13.464 --> 19:15.424
Just a one-night stand, nothing more than that.

270
19:15.591 --> 19:17.843
I hate you! You jerk!

271
19:23.140 --> 19:25.350
That asshole, my god.

272
19:37.279 --> 19:39.364
Can you move away? Why are you even here?

273
19:39.805 --> 19:41.225
And why did you get slapped?

274
19:45.067 --> 19:46.026
It's a secret.

275
19:48.373 --> 19:50.417
I had a one-night stand with that girl.

276
19:50.417 --> 19:53.253
And of course, as a gentleman, I did some aftercare.

277
19:53.688 --> 19:55.452
I even bought her breakfast.

278
19:55.589 --> 19:57.889
And then she asked me to see her here,

279
19:58.008 --> 20:01.553
and then asked if we could date each other, and I said no.

280
20:01.762 --> 20:04.213
I already told her before the one-night

281
20:04.237 --> 20:07.142
stand that we're just friends and that's it.

282
20:07.525 --> 20:10.027
And now she slapped me and walked out.

283
20:11.390 --> 20:12.538
End of a tragic story.

284
20:12.960 --> 20:13.959
Ah.

285
20:14.840 --> 20:16.007
You deserved it.

286
20:17.486 --> 20:18.444
Huh?

287
20:18.469 --> 20:19.553
What now?

288
20:19.578 --> 20:20.496
Deserve?

289
20:21.865 --> 20:23.592
What do you expect me to say?

290
20:23.825 --> 20:25.160
Okay, fine. Listen.

291
20:26.713 --> 20:28.006
Let's flip the situation.

292
20:29.373 --> 20:30.165
What if

293
20:30.165 --> 20:31.833
after our one-night stand,

294
20:32.709 --> 20:34.294
which I enjoyed, by the way,

295
20:35.379 --> 20:36.880
I asked you to

296
20:37.823 --> 20:39.783
go on a date with me.

297
20:41.677 --> 20:42.636
What would you say?

298
20:43.321 --> 20:45.699
Even without the one-night stand, I wouldn't date you.

299
20:47.998 --> 20:49.473
You didn't even think about it.

300
21:01.113 --> 21:02.364
Do you wanna date?

301
21:08.241 --> 21:08.992
No.

302
21:10.277 --> 21:11.862
Can you leave already?

303
21:11.887 --> 21:12.930
I'm studying.

304
21:12.955 --> 21:14.081
You're distracting me.

305
21:15.642 --> 21:16.458
Oh.

306
21:17.608 --> 21:20.027
So I'm distracting you now?

307
21:20.546 --> 21:22.173
It wasn't a compliment.

308
21:25.512 --> 21:26.637
Anyway—

309
21:29.975 --> 21:31.518
Just let me be here, okay?

310
21:31.518 --> 21:32.894
I mean, I have a lot of things to do also,

311
21:32.894 --> 21:35.814
but I won’t bother you. I promise, okay?

312
22:09.297 --> 22:10.048
What?

313
22:12.043 --> 22:12.627
Nothing.

314
22:12.652 --> 22:14.603
I'm just curious about what you're reading.

315
22:15.223 --> 22:16.641
You’ve got lots of sticky notes.

316
22:17.037 --> 22:18.844
I didn't know you were a serious student.

317
22:20.036 --> 22:21.872
Interested now, are we?

318
22:24.071 --> 22:26.797
Your face is as thick as that book you're holding.

319
22:32.530 --> 22:34.448
What are you smiling about?

320
22:36.990 --> 22:38.783
Am I giving you the butterflies?

321
22:40.688 --> 22:41.625
You know,

322
22:42.393 --> 22:46.648
I feel like we're at the getting-to-know stage already.

323
22:48.303 --> 22:49.971
You really are crazy.

324
23:00.262 --> 23:01.638
Hello, Arman, bro!

325
23:01.663 --> 23:02.497
What's up?

326
23:04.444 --> 23:06.738
Sorry, I can't make it to the party tonight.

327
23:07.864 --> 23:08.851
I'm on a date.

328
23:16.581 --> 23:19.751
Huh? Who?

329
23:22.045 --> 23:22.671
What?

330
23:26.192 --> 23:27.172
Okay, fine.

331
23:29.552 --> 23:31.971
Wait, who are you with?

332
23:33.557 --> 23:34.516
What?

333
23:35.039 --> 23:36.961
Okay, fine.

334
23:38.462 --> 23:40.756
All right! I’m on my way there.

335
23:42.148 --> 23:44.191
Calm her down first, I’ll be there in a bit.

336
23:45.148 --> 23:46.274
What the?

337
23:50.157 --> 23:52.200
I gotta go. P.S. Don't miss me too much.

338
23:54.632 --> 23:56.070
He’s so full of himself.

339
24:16.933 --> 24:18.059
- Yo. - Hey.

340
24:18.059 --> 24:19.062
Glad you're here.

341
24:19.087 --> 24:20.505
Your ex-fling has been looking for you..

342
24:20.530 --> 24:23.033
She's so angry. She almost broke a glass.

343
24:23.377 --> 24:24.378
What did you do?

344
24:27.490 --> 24:28.533
It's Andy.

345
24:29.750 --> 24:30.508
Be careful.

346
24:30.663 --> 24:32.206
She might throw a glass at you.

347
24:34.576 --> 24:35.577
Thank you, bro.

348
24:39.885 --> 24:41.220
They said you were looking for me.

349
24:41.917 --> 24:42.793
You know,

350
24:43.199 --> 24:45.702
I really liked you the first time I saw you in the club.

351
24:46.129 --> 24:48.924
You treated me with so much care and respect.

352
24:48.949 --> 24:50.787
And I thought you liked me too.

353
24:51.583 --> 24:54.210
I was hoping you'd call me after that night.

354
24:54.398 --> 24:58.402
But you never did. You didn't even answer my messages.

355
24:58.975 --> 25:00.435
Did you block me?

356
25:02.312 --> 25:03.396
Andy—

357
25:04.648 --> 25:06.233
There's nothing special in what I did.

358
25:07.442 --> 25:08.610
It's just bare minimum.

359
25:09.402 --> 25:10.654
Bare minimum?

360
25:11.112 --> 25:15.367
You kissed me, called me beautiful and held my hand.

361
25:15.367 --> 25:17.118
And we were intimate.

362
25:18.161 --> 25:21.164
It's just all physical intimacy. Nothing else.

363
25:21.373 --> 25:22.874
Look, if you're a commitment

364
25:22.874 --> 25:25.460
type of person, you go for another person who...

365
25:26.753 --> 25:27.879
matches your energy.

366
25:28.674 --> 25:31.968
So don't waste your time on people like me.

367
25:34.928 --> 25:37.597
I hope you can find someone

368
25:38.014 --> 25:39.391
who'll give you everything you need.

369
25:39.575 --> 25:41.131
And obviously, it's not me.

370
25:41.726 --> 25:43.687
Oh, please don't slap me.

371
25:43.687 --> 25:48.066
because I already got slapped earlier, and I can't handle getting hit again.

372
25:48.608 --> 25:51.444
I have no time to spare on someone like you.

373
25:59.452 --> 26:01.037
Same old you.

374
26:02.081 --> 26:04.060
Non-believer of love, huh?

375
26:06.803 --> 26:08.138
You can finish that.

376
26:10.901 --> 26:11.771
Oh.

377
26:12.298 --> 26:13.174
Sorry.

378
26:15.135 --> 26:16.678
Lopez!

379
26:17.386 --> 26:18.554
You're here.

380
26:18.805 --> 26:19.489
What's up?

381
26:19.514 --> 26:20.473
How are you?

382
26:21.308 --> 26:22.201
Miguel.

383
26:22.226 --> 26:23.352
Big man.

384
26:24.818 --> 26:25.444
Let's go.

385
26:25.896 --> 26:28.899
Is that the mayor's kid?

386
26:29.608 --> 26:30.525
Yup.

387
26:31.484 --> 26:32.777
How do you know him?

388
26:33.187 --> 26:35.773
He's just my classmate from law school.

389
27:43.098 --> 27:45.266
I'm home!

390
27:45.266 --> 27:46.977
How did your group project go?

391
27:46.977 --> 27:49.354
Oh my god, I survived it.

392
27:49.604 --> 27:50.545
Wait.

393
27:53.873 --> 27:54.526
Hold on.

394
27:54.908 --> 27:57.271
Hey, why do you look like that? You look sick.

395
27:57.910 --> 27:58.869
No, I'm fine.

396
27:58.894 --> 28:01.855
I just woke up early because I wanted to study.

397
28:02.492 --> 28:05.495
Come on, get some rest.

398
28:05.520 --> 28:07.555
You might actually get sick later.

399
28:07.580 --> 28:08.974
No, I'm fine.

400
28:08.999 --> 28:10.208
I took a nap earlier.

401
28:10.208 --> 28:11.745
and I'll sleep in a bit, too.

402
28:12.002 --> 28:12.836
I'm going out.

403
28:12.836 --> 28:15.441
Do you want me to buy something? Food? Medicine?

404
28:15.776 --> 28:17.331
- I'm good. - You okay?

405
28:17.465 --> 28:18.216
- Go. - Okay.

406
28:18.216 --> 28:19.092
I love you.

407
28:19.092 --> 28:20.135
- Bye. - Bye!

408
28:37.277 --> 28:40.864
Our house blend is a medium roast with notes of cocoa and nuts.

409
28:40.864 --> 28:43.867
But if you want something stronger, I suggest go for our Italian blend.

410
28:44.214 --> 28:45.299
Sure, I'll take that.

411
28:45.535 --> 28:46.745
All right. Iced?

412
28:46.911 --> 28:48.455
- Yes. - All right, for here, right?

413
28:48.455 --> 28:49.305
Mhmm.

414
28:49.330 --> 28:50.999
That would be 200 pesos.

415
28:51.111 --> 28:52.130
Okay.

416
28:52.814 --> 28:53.690
Thank you.

417
28:55.241 --> 28:57.118
- Thank you. - Please wait by the side, thank you.

418
28:58.882 --> 28:59.841
Good—

419
29:02.260 --> 29:03.318
Are you okay?

420
29:03.511 --> 29:05.615
One Iced Americano,

421
29:05.810 --> 29:11.490
or if the Italian blend is stronger like you mentioned,

422
29:11.618 --> 29:12.494
I’ll go with that.

423
29:13.203 --> 29:14.496
I don't think you need some coffee.

424
29:15.728 --> 29:17.021
It looks like sleep is what you need.

425
29:17.332 --> 29:19.458
Of all the baristas I've met,

426
29:19.659 --> 29:21.536
you're the only one who sticks your nose in my business.

427
29:22.489 --> 29:23.716
I don't want to sleep.

428
29:26.276 --> 29:27.402
Take a seat then.

429
29:28.119 --> 29:29.704
I'll prepare your coffee.

430
29:29.797 --> 29:30.590
How much?

431
29:31.247 --> 29:32.169
Just pay later.

432
30:29.479 --> 30:31.314
Miguel, please slow down.

433
30:31.512 --> 30:32.703
Just tell me.

434
30:32.728 --> 30:35.320
Admit it, you're cheating on me.

435
30:35.436 --> 30:37.564
You're cheating on me, huh?

436
30:37.589 --> 30:39.133
That's why you won't stay away from that guy.

437
30:39.355 --> 30:41.039
Didn't I tell you to stay away from him?

438
30:41.233 --> 30:43.777
They're my friends, they're harmless, and can you please stop—

439
30:43.903 --> 30:46.239
You're such a slut! Stop fucking lying!

440
30:46.447 --> 30:47.740
Stop fucking lying!

441
30:47.998 --> 30:49.207
You lied to me!

442
30:49.299 --> 30:50.461
I told you to stay away!

443
30:50.486 --> 30:52.203
You won't stay away! Do you know why?

444
30:52.602 --> 30:53.394
You know what I think?

445
30:53.644 --> 30:54.687
You're fucking each other.

446
30:54.998 --> 30:55.582
- You're fucking! - Miguel…

447
30:55.582 --> 30:56.875
You're fucking each other!

448
30:57.458 --> 31:00.253
You bitch, you're definitely gonna get it later!

449
31:00.253 --> 31:01.906
Be grateful I'm driving right now.

450
31:02.088 --> 31:05.091
You're gonna regret this. Stop crying!

451
31:05.383 --> 31:07.010
I said, stop. You won't stop, huh?

452
31:07.010 --> 31:08.078
You won't stop?

453
31:08.185 --> 31:09.227
Enough!

454
31:15.953 --> 31:16.687
Kierra?

455
31:17.107 --> 31:17.858
Kierra.

456
31:17.883 --> 31:19.093
Kierra, Kierra.

457
31:19.118 --> 31:20.411
Hey, hey, you're okay.

458
31:20.436 --> 31:22.104
Kierra, you’re okay. You’re okay.

459
31:22.758 --> 31:23.800
Can I hold you?

460
31:24.791 --> 31:26.459
I'm going to hold you, okay?

461
31:26.487 --> 31:28.239
You’re safe here, okay? Listen.

462
31:28.573 --> 31:29.866
Hey, you’re okay. You’re okay.

463
31:30.827 --> 31:32.805
Breathe with me. Breathe with me, slowly.

464
31:33.195 --> 31:34.245
You're safe here.

465
31:34.245 --> 31:36.664
Kierra, you're safe here. Okay?

466
31:37.342 --> 31:38.289
Okay.

467
31:38.468 --> 31:39.375
Kierra.

468
31:40.084 --> 31:41.127
Breathe with me.

469
31:41.567 --> 31:42.527
Slowly,

470
31:43.213 --> 31:44.422
Breathe in.

471
31:45.965 --> 31:47.133
Breathe out.

472
31:47.133 --> 31:48.301
Okay, you’re good.

473
31:48.551 --> 31:49.344
You’re good.

474
31:49.344 --> 31:50.845
Close your eyes, Kierra. Close your eyes.

475
31:50.970 --> 31:51.763
Please.

476
31:52.062 --> 31:53.072
There.

477
31:53.097 --> 31:55.099
Listen to my voice, you’re okay.

478
31:55.701 --> 31:56.910
Breathe in.

479
31:58.186 --> 31:59.229
Breathe out.

480
31:59.812 --> 32:00.980
That's right.

481
32:01.773 --> 32:02.941
One more time, Kierra.

482
32:03.983 --> 32:08.613
Breathe in, breathe out.

483
32:29.801 --> 32:31.010
Yes.

484
32:36.391 --> 32:37.976
You’re safe here, Kierra.

485
32:38.893 --> 32:40.103
You're okay.

486
32:42.063 --> 32:43.439
I’ll just get you water, okay?

487
32:43.464 --> 32:44.882
I’ll be back, stay there.

488
32:57.829 --> 32:59.163
Let me walk you home.

489
32:59.689 --> 33:00.481
No.

490
33:02.296 --> 33:03.631
I don't want to go home yet.

491
33:05.826 --> 33:08.370
I don't want my cousin to see me like this.

492
33:13.219 --> 33:14.758
Let's go somewhere else.

493
33:19.183 --> 33:20.101
All right.

494
33:22.061 --> 33:23.604
I'll take you out on a date.

495
33:27.775 --> 33:29.027
Let’s go.

496
33:42.072 --> 33:42.969
Let’s go.

497
34:08.918 --> 34:10.878
I can't believe you brought me here to Bataan.

498
34:12.794 --> 34:14.629
Do you know my dad is from here?

499
34:16.616 --> 34:17.200
Wait.

500
34:18.095 --> 34:19.619
Is that why you brought me here?

501
34:19.619 --> 34:20.915
Because you know my family’s from here?

502
34:20.940 --> 34:21.983
Are you stalking me?

503
34:22.997 --> 34:23.915
What are you saying?

504
34:25.579 --> 34:26.831
I live here too.

505
34:26.918 --> 34:28.002
I lived here with my

506
34:28.002 --> 34:29.295
mom and my stepdad.

507
34:31.354 --> 34:32.897
Why did you guys move to Manila?

508
34:36.741 --> 34:38.243
I was the only one who moved.

509
34:38.767 --> 34:40.185
You left them here?

510
34:50.274 --> 34:53.444
It's really different when you're at the beach.

511
34:54.775 --> 34:56.814
It feels so refreshing.

512
34:56.839 --> 35:00.165
I feel like I can sleep soundly tonight.

513
35:00.497 --> 35:01.623
I noticed...

514
35:03.996 --> 35:06.165
you're having a lot of nightmares.

515
35:07.417 --> 35:09.252
That night at the Claremont,

516
35:10.253 --> 35:11.963
you were having nightmares, too.

517
35:13.089 --> 35:17.051
Weren't you scared when you saw me like that?

518
35:19.345 --> 35:20.173
No.

519
35:22.598 --> 35:25.059
Everyone's fighting their own demons, Kierra.

520
35:26.102 --> 35:28.062
I hope you don't mind me asking.

521
35:28.980 --> 35:31.149
Have you tried seeking professional help?

522
35:33.985 --> 35:35.403
Doctor Bautista.

523
35:37.280 --> 35:38.448
But I stopped going.

524
35:39.949 --> 35:40.689
Why?

525
35:41.673 --> 35:43.786
I know they say that

526
35:43.786 --> 35:48.124
healing takes me, but I'm getting impatient.

527
35:49.750 --> 35:53.045
It's exhausting to think that things will get better.

528
35:53.345 --> 35:56.532
Because when night comes, I still have nightmares.

529
35:57.990 --> 36:00.201
I just want my old life back.

530
36:02.395 --> 36:05.282
The one where I'm not scared to go out.

531
36:06.434 --> 36:08.978
Where I'm not afraid to sleep.

532
36:10.426 --> 36:11.511
Where...

533
36:12.607 --> 36:14.368
I can laugh genuinely.

534
36:20.697 --> 36:22.845
I’m sorry. I got carried away.

535
36:23.753 --> 36:26.554
Those are just my thoughts.

536
36:26.579 --> 36:27.997
Don't take it too seriously.

537
36:28.505 --> 36:30.882
It's okay. I get you.

538
36:33.505 --> 36:34.757
I know it's hard.

539
36:35.715 --> 36:37.592
But I know you'll defeat your demons.

540
36:38.301 --> 36:39.594
How can you be so sure?

541
36:41.938 --> 36:45.358
Because who can defeat someone

542
36:45.383 --> 36:48.476
who can drink 3 cups of coffee in 5 hours, right?

543
36:48.900 --> 36:50.694
Excuse me.

544
36:50.937 --> 36:52.188
Three cups.

545
36:52.884 --> 36:55.219
I can only handle two. I still love my life, okay.

546
37:02.114 --> 37:02.990
Glad to know.

547
37:03.240 --> 37:03.949
Know what?

548
37:05.473 --> 37:06.850
That you still love your life.

549
37:13.251 --> 37:14.501
Hey, wait!

550
37:16.191 --> 37:17.275
You took so long.

551
37:21.905 --> 37:22.822
Hey!

552
37:32.446 --> 37:34.251
Do you feel better now?

553
37:37.006 --> 37:39.126
Weirdly... Yes.

554
37:45.395 --> 37:47.355
It's not weird to be happy.

555
38:41.797 --> 38:43.633
I feel suffocated.

556
38:45.176 --> 38:46.677
It's like I can't breathe.

557
38:49.764 --> 38:51.265
And when I'm outside,

558
38:51.641 --> 38:52.975
I feel anxious.

559
38:53.768 --> 38:56.771
I'm afraid I might bump into him.

560
38:56.796 --> 39:00.022
I don't know where I can hide.

561
39:07.948 --> 39:08.577
Ke!

562
39:08.847 --> 39:09.848
Ke, Ke!

563
39:10.201 --> 39:11.243
Ke!

564
39:11.481 --> 39:12.334
Why?

565
39:13.143 --> 39:13.858
Ke.

566
39:14.405 --> 39:15.639
What’s wrong?

567
39:16.999 --> 39:19.210
- Ke… - It's so unfair, Luna.

568
39:20.040 --> 39:21.792
He can have fun.

569
39:21.985 --> 39:24.988
He can party without a care in the world!

570
39:26.039 --> 39:27.553
It's infuriating,

571
39:28.010 --> 39:30.179
like he didn't do anything wrong.

572
39:30.859 --> 39:33.028
How about me?

573
39:34.525 --> 39:35.424
Ke…

574
39:35.449 --> 39:36.450
Ke.

575
39:36.475 --> 39:37.560
How?

576
39:38.158 --> 39:40.053
Why is it so easy for him?

577
39:44.188 --> 39:46.194
Doesn't he have a conscience?

578
39:48.948 --> 39:50.533
He doesn’t…

579
39:50.991 --> 39:52.492
I'm right here, okay?

580
39:57.206 --> 39:58.436
Don't cry anymore.

581
40:09.717 --> 40:10.515
Thank you, ma'am.

582
40:10.540 --> 40:11.667
Just wait at your table, please.

583
40:11.692 --> 40:12.484
Thank you.

584
40:13.723 --> 40:15.307
Ah, two—

585
40:15.846 --> 40:17.056
Iced Americano?

586
40:18.886 --> 40:20.346
Alex, I'll take care of this.

587
40:20.392 --> 40:22.144
- Yes. - Just serve this to table two.

588
40:22.169 --> 40:23.754
- I got it from here. - Okay.

589
40:28.904 --> 40:29.874
Rough night?

590
40:31.229 --> 40:32.170
Didn’t sleep much.

591
40:32.535 --> 40:36.330
Two lattes and two corned beef pandesal.

592
40:37.045 --> 40:40.048
So, no iced Americano today.

593
40:40.458 --> 40:42.209
I wanna try a different drink.

594
40:42.557 --> 40:46.019
You wanna try something different but you're choosing latte?

595
40:46.896 --> 40:49.649
Now you're even meddling with my drink choices.

596
40:51.877 --> 40:53.378
Let me make you a special drink,

597
40:54.685 --> 40:55.686
to switch things up.

598
40:57.850 --> 40:58.893
Fine.

599
40:58.893 --> 41:00.311
Surprise me then.

600
41:01.061 --> 41:02.480
Make sure it's good.

601
41:03.981 --> 41:05.107
Okay.

602
41:27.546 --> 41:29.028
Here’s your order, ma’am.

603
41:31.842 --> 41:34.762
That is called a Sakura drink.

604
41:36.180 --> 41:38.015
Iced strawberry latte made with love.

605
41:39.934 --> 41:42.192
I even added extra strawberries for you.

606
41:42.410 --> 41:44.954
It's your favorite, right? I remember.

607
41:46.544 --> 41:47.966
Does it taste good, though?

608
41:48.716 --> 41:49.700
Try it.

609
41:57.910 --> 41:59.328
Why is it special?

610
42:00.788 --> 42:01.872
Because...

611
42:04.398 --> 42:05.858
I only made it for you.

612
42:06.708 --> 42:08.042
Give me a break.

613
42:12.882 --> 42:14.259
You really like it, huh?

614
42:15.233 --> 42:18.236
Well, you won't find that anywhere else.

615
42:19.234 --> 42:21.487
That's why you have no choice but to come back here.

616
42:22.765 --> 42:23.891
You fell into my trap.

617
42:26.355 --> 42:27.356
Whatever.

618
43:40.598 --> 43:41.894
Yo, Neil. What's up?

619
43:42.125 --> 43:43.626
Bro, where are you?

620
43:44.433 --> 43:45.231
Why?

621
43:45.586 --> 43:48.662
Bro, don't tell me you're ditching the party tonight.

622
43:48.687 --> 43:49.897
The whole gang's gonna be there.

623
43:50.714 --> 43:53.375
Sorry, bro. I'm gonna have to pass today.

624
43:53.400 --> 43:56.036
Shan’s passing on a party?

625
43:57.172 --> 43:58.270
You serious?

626
44:01.728 --> 44:02.614
It’s nothing.

627
44:02.753 --> 44:04.723
I gotta go. Have fun.

628
44:04.838 --> 44:06.089
I'm driving right now.

629
44:06.114 --> 44:07.032
I guess.

630
44:07.057 --> 44:08.141
See you, man.

631
44:14.788 --> 44:15.580
Yeah.

632
44:16.775 --> 44:17.859
Just get some rest.

633
44:19.161 --> 44:20.802
Looks like you've been through a lot.

634
44:22.304 --> 44:24.223
Just take a good rest.

635
44:25.432 --> 44:26.600
I'll be right here.

636
44:43.200 --> 44:44.827
Good morning!

637
44:46.161 --> 44:46.912
Hello!

638
44:48.559 --> 44:50.629
Um... Hi?

639
44:51.625 --> 44:52.960
Are you new here?

640
44:54.545 --> 44:55.587
What are you doing?

641
44:56.088 --> 44:58.924
Oh, your sandcastle is so pretty!

642
44:59.278 --> 45:01.906
But why does your toy look broken?

643
45:02.928 --> 45:04.263
Are you from Bataan?

644
45:06.846 --> 45:08.181
I'm from here, too.

645
45:08.583 --> 45:10.286
This is where my dad's from.

646
45:10.756 --> 45:14.489
But we're just on vacation, about 3 days now.

647
45:14.708 --> 45:16.950
What's your name? I'm Ayi.

648
45:17.304 --> 45:18.514
That's my nickname.

649
45:39.676 --> 45:42.804
Ayi! Let's go, time to eat.

650
45:43.075 --> 45:44.493
Okay, mommy.

651
45:44.875 --> 45:47.122
We have to go. See you when I see you!

652
46:07.281 --> 46:08.574
See you yesterday.

653
46:09.745 --> 46:11.538
Yesterday’s already in the past.

654
46:11.538 --> 46:13.123
You should say, “See you soon”.

655
46:13.123 --> 46:13.916
Shan!

656
46:13.916 --> 46:15.167
You’ve thought about it?

657
46:16.335 --> 46:17.711
- Frat? - Mhmm.

658
46:17.711 --> 46:19.922
There are a lot of perks to being a fraternity brother.

659
46:23.360 --> 46:24.606
What’s your problem?

660
46:25.177 --> 46:26.553
Are you doing anything later?

661
46:27.971 --> 46:29.389
Do you want another escape?

662
46:29.654 --> 46:30.926
Where are we going?

663
46:38.757 --> 46:40.968
What? Do you want more—

664
46:42.277 --> 46:43.237
Shan?

665
46:43.862 --> 46:45.656
I knew it, you fucker—

666
46:59.211 --> 47:00.629
Long time no see.

667
47:01.463 --> 47:02.381
You have a date?

668
47:03.674 --> 47:04.508
Uh—

669
47:06.218 --> 47:07.136
Um—
